## ===== Secrets (never commit these) =====
*.pfx
*.key
secrets.json

# Web Deploy credentials. The .PublishSettings downloaded from the host carries the
# deploy password in plain text, and the .pubxml.user Visual Studio writes beside an
# imported profile carries it encrypted to this machine only.
*.PublishSettings
*.pubxml.user

# Git worktrees Claude Code creates. Never part of the repo.
.claude/worktrees/
